<title>USA: Allied Digital FY 96 shr loss with charges.</title>
<headline>Allied Digital FY 96 shr loss with charges.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.41   profit	 $0.05</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   5,585   profit	   667</p>
<p> Sales		    163,781		  161,308</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,620		   13,621</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Fiscal year ended July 31.  </p>
<p>Fiscal 1996 results include one-time pre-tax charges of about $4.4 million, including a restructuring charge of about $3.1 million and a non-recurring charge of $1.25 million relating to a customer contract.</p>
<p>They also include additional depreciation charges of about $2 million relating to equipment purchases and increased interest expense of about $1.3 million from additional borrowing to finance capital expenditures.</p>
<p>Full company name is Allied Digitial Technologies Corp.</p>
</text>
